  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "미르갈레트를 뛰어넘는\n굉장한 미르갈레트를 만들 생각입니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C0020B6F0C5B4B118B294000AAD49C7A5D55C0020BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C0020B9CCB4E40020C0DDAC01C785B2C8B2E4002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한 가지 문제가 있다면...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D55C0020AC00C9C00020BB38C81CAC000020C788B2E4BA74002E002E002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "굉장한 미르갈레트를 나눠 줄\n사나이다운 포켓몬이 없단 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD49C7A5D55C0020BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C0020B098B2200020C904000AC0ACB098C774B2E4C6B40020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C5C6B2E80020B9D0C774C8E0002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가게 이름도 사나이 카페인데 말입니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00AC8C0020C774B984B3C40020C0ACB098C7740020CE74D398C778B3700020B9D0C785B2C8B2E4002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사나이다움을 강조하는 시대는 아니지만\n가게의 이름을 무시할 수는 없으니...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB098C774B2E4C6C0C7440020AC15C870D558B2940020C2DCB300B2940020C544B2C8C9C0B9CC000AAC00AC8CC7580020C774B984C7440020BB34C2DCD5600020C218B2940020C5C6C73CB2C8002E002E002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시 주제를 벗어나 버렸군요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n굉장한 미르갈레트를\n손님들에게 나눠 줄 포켓몬으로...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DC0020C8FCC81CB97C0020BC97C5B4B0980020BC84B838AD70C694002E00100001BE01000AAD49C7A5D55C0020BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C000AC190B2D8B4E4C5D0AC8C0020B098B2200020C9040020D3ECCF13BAACC73CB85C002E002E002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사나이다운 에써르를 제게 양보해 주세요!\n부탁드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB098C774B2E4C6B40020C5D0C368B974B97C0020C81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC138C6940021000ABD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사나이다운 에써르를\n제게 양보해 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB098C774B2E4C6B40020C5D0C368B974B97C000AC81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오! 사나이다운 에써르가\n저희 카페에 합류한다면 아주 든든할 겁니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C62400210020C0ACB098C774B2E4C6B40020C5D0C368B974AC00000AC800D76C0020CE74D398C5D00020D569B958D55CB2E4BA740020C544C8FC0020B4E0B4E0D5600020AC81B2C8B2E4002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사나이다운 에써르를 제게 양보해 주세요!\n부탁드리겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB098C774B2E4C6B40020C5D0C368B974B97C0020C81CAC8C0020C591BCF4D5740020C8FCC138C6940021000ABD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사나이다운\n에써르가 있다면...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB098C774B2E4C6B4000AC5D0C368B974AC000020C788B2E4BA74002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오! 느껴집니다!\n정말 사나이다워 보이는 에써르군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C62400210020B290AEF4C9D1B2C8B2E40021000AC815B9D00020C0ACB098C774B2E4C6CC0020BCF4C774B2940020C5D0C368B974AD70C694002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오! 암컷이지만 마음가짐은\n정말 사나이다워 보이는 에써르군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C62400210020C554CEF7C774C9C0B9CC0020B9C8C74CAC00C9D0C740000AC815B9D00020C0ACB098C774B2E4C6CC0020BCF4C774B2940020C5D0C368B974AD70C694002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 미르갈레트를 뛰어넘는\n굉장한 미르갈레트를 만들어 볼까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C0020B6F0C5B4B118B294000AAD49C7A5D55C0020BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCFCAE4CC694003F00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이름하여! 기가미르갈레트!\n맞습니다! 메가를 뛰어넘는 기가!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n정말 사나이다운 발상과 행동력이지 않나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B984D558C5EC00210020AE30AC00BBF8B974AC08B808D2B80021000AB9DEC2B5B2C8B2E400210020BA54AC00B97C0020B6F0C5B4B118B2940020AE30AC00002100100001BE00000AC815B9D00020C0ACB098C774B2E4C6B40020BC1CC0C1ACFC0020D589B3D9B825C774C9C00020C54AB098C694003F00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "에써르! 갓 만든 기가미르갈레트를\n손님께 내어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5D0C368B97400210020AC130020B9CCB4E00020AE30AC00BBF8B974AC08B808D2B8B97C000AC190B2D8AED80020B0B4C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이런, 너무 커서\n커피를 둘 자리가 없다니...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B7F0002C0020B108BB340020CEE4C11C000ACEE4D53CB97C0020B4580020C790B9ACAC000020C5C6B2E4B2C8002E002E002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사나이다움이\n조금 지나쳤던 모양이네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB098C774B2E4C6C0C774000AC870AE080020C9C0B098CCE4B3580020BAA8C591C774B124C694002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그나마 에써르가 사나이다운\n포켓몬이라는 걸 알게 돼서 다행이군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B098B9C80020C5D0C368B974AC000020C0ACB098C774B2E4C6B4000AD3ECCF13BAACC774B77CB2940020AC780020C54CAC8C0020B3FCC11C0020B2E4D589C774AD70C694002E00100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "써르.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C368B974002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "에써르! 앞으로 함께\n사나이 카페를 번창하게 만들어 보죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƫ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5D0C368B97400210020C55EC73CB85C0020D568AED8000AC0ACB098C7740020CE74D398B97C0020BC88CC3DD558AC8C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BCF4C8E0002100100002011401AB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
